  "items": [
    {
      "_id": "nCLdi7H5jz3tZbTl",
      "name": "伪足Pseudopod",
      "type": "weapon",
      "system": {
        "source": {
          "custom": "",
          "book": "MM'14",
          "page": "243",
          "license": "",
          "rules": "2014",
          "revision": 1
        },
        "description": {
          "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\"><em>近战武器攻击：</em>命中</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">+3</span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">，触及</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">5</span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">尺，单一目标。<em>命中：</em></span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">4</span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">（</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">1d6+1</span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">）点钝击伤害，外加</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">7</span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">（</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">2d6</span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">）点强酸伤害。此外，如果目标着装非魔法的金属护甲，则该护甲被部分腐蚀，其提供的</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">AC</span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">遭受</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">-1</span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">减值且累计叠加。</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">AC</span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">被降至</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">10</span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">时，则该护甲被摧毁。</span></p><p><em>Melee Weapon Attack:</em> [[/r 1d20+3]]{+3} to hit, reach 5 ft., one target. <em>Hit:</em> 4 ([[/damage 1d6 + 1 type=bludgeoning]]) damage plus 7 ([[/damage 2d6 type=acid]]) damage, and if the target is wearing nonmagical metal armor, its armor is partly corroded and takes a permanent and cumulative −1 penalty to the AC it offers. The armor is destroyed if the penalty reduces its AC to 10.</p></div>",
