        "description": {
          "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">泥怪能够轻松穿过最窄</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">1</span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">寸宽的狭窄空间而不用挤进去。</span></p><p>The ooze can move through a space as narrow as 1 inch wide without squeezing.</p></div>",
